t:
I'm busy... Since muses are benevolent today, I have come up with something:

What troubles you?

Tell me! Is it love tormenting your heart?

Who are they? Who will I seduce?

Who will it be?

A recent runaway is here to stay;

Who shunned the gift will come bearing gifts;

Who loves today will love once more;

But it will be unrequited...
